{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "131", "x": 0.8997849334044037, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03395831519923213, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "READING PASSAGE 3", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.19962030777940348, "w": 0.29152886031313374, "h": 0.023179739115831682, "c": 1, "size": 16.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "A new role for livestock guard dogs", "x": 0.2638916955094993, "y": 0.24424439448790872, "w": 0.5151313503571918, "h": 0.026142565890596797, "c": 1, "size": 18.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Livestock guard dogs, traditionally used to protect farm animals from predators,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3316309417417234, "w": 0.8261858830725457, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "are now being used to protect the predators themselves", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.35996129181586106, "w": 0.5746074345150052, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "A", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3982295690753385, "w": 0.02121427120700475, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "For thousands of years, livestock guard dogs worked alongside shepherds", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.3982295690753385, "w": 0.7656011196955255, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "to protect their sheep, goats and cattle from predators such as wolves and bears.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.42655991914947616, "w": 0.8262294561779128, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "But in the 19th and 20th centuries, when such predators were largely", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.45489030694500626, "w": 0.8259682225956181, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "exterminated, most guard dogs lost their jobs. In recent years, however, as", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.483245402252631, "w": 0.8265066836530011, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "increased efforts have been made to protect wild animals, predators have become", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5114274318114159, "w": 0.8263600729690601, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "more widespread again. As a result, farmers once more need to protect their", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5397578196069461, "w": 0.826099044436673, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "livestock, and guard dogs are enjoying an unexpected revival.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5680881696810838, "w": 0.6292838898541613, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "B", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6063564469405612, "w": 0.020206412464245704, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Today there are around 50 breeds of guard dogs on duty in various parts of", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.6063564469405612, "w": 0.7656442827010773, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the world. These dogs are raised from an early age with the animals they will be", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6346867970146988, "w": 0.8261204721520182, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "watching and eventually these animals become the dog's family. The dogs will", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6630542649390672, "w": 0.8260988393867654, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "place themselves between the livestock and any threat, barking loudly. If", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6913846150132047, "w": 0.8261818845993474, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "necessary, they will chase away predators, but often their mere presence is", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7197149650873423, "w": 0.8261640452573853, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "sufficient. 'Their initial training is to make them understand that livestock is going", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.748045390604265, "w": 0.8262077208877061, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "to be their life,' says Dan Macon, a shepherd with three guard dogs. 'A fluffy white", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7763757406784026, "w": 0.8264401449579817, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "puppy is fun to be around, but too much human affection makes it a great dog for", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8047060907525403, "w": 0.8263168074385545, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "guarding the front porch, rather than a great livestock guard dog.'", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8328881957541102, "w": 0.6738313411196934, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "C", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8711811428042898, "w": 0.02101269433220525, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "The evidence indicates that guard dogs are highly effective. For example, in", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.8711811428042898, "w": 0.7662748111669769, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Portugal, biologist Silvia Ribeiro has found that more than 90 per cent of the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8995114928784275, "w": 0.8258593410946774, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "farmers participating in a programme to train and use guard dogs to protect their", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.927841842952565, "w": 0.8263382351538997, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}